From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 11:30:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] dng_sdk: keep the library core-only

DNG 1.7.1 links the core-only XMP toolkit. Drop the unused vendor variant so
Soong does not request a vendor/static XMP dependency for the Infiniti graph.
---
 Android.bp | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -103,7 +103,6 @@ cc_library {
     host_supported: true,
     sdk_version: "current",
     defaults: ["libdng_sdk-defaults"],
-    vendor_available: true,
 
     sanitize: {
         // For now we want to disable the ubsan_minimal runtime so that we can
